[ti:Hemant Jogi aakhda sun shaheed shera]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Folk & Regional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:14.70]Hemant Jogi aakhda, sun shaheed shera
[00:21.40]Main tap kita janglan vich, main jaap kita gufavan vich
[00:28.09]Par tere darshan hoe, taan samjhiya jog ki hai
[00:34.79]Tera naam hai mera mantra, teri shahadat hai mera jaap
[00:41.49]Main sannyasi si, sansaar ton bhajjia
[00:48.19]Par tu mainu sikhaya ki sachha sannyas ki hai
[00:54.88]Sachha sannyasi oh nahi jo jangal bhajje
[01:01.58]Sachha sannyasi oh hai jo shaheed di maa de dar te jhuke
[01:08.28]He shaheed shera, main tainu ki bhet karaan?
[01:14.98]Mere kol kuch nahi — na sona, na chandi, na maal
[01:21.68]Mere kol sirf ikk jogi di jholi hai
[01:28.37]Uh jholi main tere naam karda haan
[01:35.07]Hun ton main shaheedan da bhikhari haan
[01:48.47]Mardana bolia —
[01:55.16]Hemant Jogi da uffara sun liya main
[02:01.86]Hun ih rabab vi shaheedan di ho gayi
[02:08.56]Jihadi dhuni Nanak di seva vich vajji
[02:15.26]Hun uh dhuni shaheedan de naam te goonjegi
[02:28.65]Hemant Jogi da uffara swikaar hai
[02:42.05]Sach da faqir hun sach de shaheed da sevadaar hoyia
[02:55.44]Jogi di jholi hun shaheedan da khazaana hai
[03:08.84]Hemant Jogi, tu shaheedan da jogi hai
[03:22.24]He shaheed shera!
[03:28.93]Terri yaad hai mera tap
[03:35.63]Tera sach hai mera jog
[03:42.33]Terri maa hai meri devi
[03:49.03]Tera naam hai mera rabb
[03:55.72]Ih jholi main tere naam karda haan
[04:02.42]Hun ton main shaheedan da jogi haan
